Let keyword in bashscripting is used to perform basic arithmetic operations 


example:-

#!/usr/bin/env bash

no1=4
no2=5

let result=no1+no2
echo $result

let no1++

let no2++

let no1+=6

let no2-=5

[] and (()) will do the same thing 

[]
--

result=$[ no1 + no2 ]

()
--

result=$(( no1+no2 ))



